                                "sense_id": "048dce0a-6cb1-3085-9631-0c8736870bc9",
                                "text": "No winnable seat has been found for Mr. H. L. Nathan, a powerful recruit from the Liberal ranks, and poor Mr. Wedgwood Benn, an invaluable sniper for a party in Opposition, has been out of Parliament now since 1931."
